 Cohen, Steve [D-TN-9]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-03-03","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"TN"},{"bioguideId":"S001230","fullName":"Rep. Subramanyam, Suhas [D-VA-10]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-03-04","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"VA"},{"bioguideId":"P000197","fullName":"Rep. Pelosi, Nancy [D-CA-11]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-03-04","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CA"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-17T17:37:17+00:00","id":"hconres38-119","introducedDate":"2025-06-17","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2026-03-05","actionTime":"16:38:01","text":"Motion to reconsider laid on the table Agreed to without objection."},"laws":[],"number":"38","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"International Affairs","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"M001184","district":4,"fullName":"Rep. Massie, Thomas [R-KY-4]","party":"R","state":"KY"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-06-17","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p>This concurrent resolution directs the President to terminate the use of U.S. Armed Forces from hostilities against Iran or any part of the Iranian government or military unless a declaration of war or authorization to use military force for such purpose has been enacted.</p><p>The resolution specifies that it shall not be construed to prevent the United States from defending itself from imminent attack.</p>","updateDate":"2026-02-27T21:02:09Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Directing the President pursuant to section 5(c) of the War Powers Resolution to remove United States Armed Forces from unauthorized hostilities in the Islamic Republic of Iran.","type":"hconres","updateDate":"2026-03-10T16:05:32Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-03-10T16:05:32Z"}
